  "policy_summary": "Venue general liability, medical payments cover: pays reasonable first-aid and medical costs for a guest hurt on the venue's premises during the event, no fault needed, up to $5,000.00 per claim and $25,000.00 for the event, services within 30 days of the incident, each service capped by the venue fee schedule. It does not pay for injuries that happened elsewhere or before the event.",
